# Mail cron jobs for [% domain %]
[%# Trains the Bayes database of amavis, which scores the mail, from the folders
    of every account.  Spam is the Junk folder and the spam_folders of the
    account.  Ham is every other folder, but not INBOX, Trash, Drafts or Sent.
    scripts/sa_train_amavis has the whole rule.  One call for each account,
    because each account has its own spam_folders. -%]
[% FOR account IN names.keys().sort() -%]
21 2 * * * root [% INCLUDE "files/mail.train.tt" WITH make = 0, account = account -%]
[% END -%]
